OL,3,GNEWSAInspirational mother who shared
OL,4,Abrain cancer battle will be 'forever
OL,5,Amissed'
OL,6,
OL,7,FTributes have been paid to a mother who
OL,8,Fhas died nine months after she was
OL,9,Fdiagnosed with incurable brain cancer.
OL,11,FKim Borthwick, 36, from Glasgow, was
OL,12,Ftold the devastating news on 18
OL,13,FJanuary, just a week after she began
OL,14,Fexperiencing symptoms.
OL,16,FShe later shared her experiences of
OL,17,Fliving with the condition on social
OL,18,Fmedia, and spoke of the clarity she
OL,19,Fgained to appreciate the special
OL,20,Fmoments with her husband and twin
OL,21,Ffour-year-old sons during the time she
OL,22,Fhad left.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
